      "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}\\sqrt{\\frac{x+2y}{8y}} &= \\sqrt{\\frac{5.6+2(3.1)}{8(3.1)}}\\\\\\sqrt{\\frac{x+2y}{8y}} &= \\sqrt{\\frac{11.8}{24.8}}\\\\\\sqrt{\\frac{x+2y}{8y}} &\\approx 0.69\\end{align*}$$\nCorrect answer: A.",
